Abstract = {Evaluation of the urbanization is a complicated systematic engineering,
   which involves population, economy, society, environment, etc. This
   paper estimated the urbanization level in Tianjin in terms of economic
   urbanization, industrial structure urbanization, population urbanization
   and life style urbanization using 14 sub-indexes. Having extracted 3
   components with principal component analysis method, this paper
   inspected the degree of urbanization in Tianjin by utilizing correlation
   analysis to analyze the integrated scores from principal component
   analysis method and population urbanization using single index. Then it
   offered some suggestions based on the current status of development,
   which provided some reference for the further development of Tianjin
   urbanization.},
