   Management},
Abstract = {Every city is composed of lots of communities, so the building of
   resoure saving and environment friendly society must be carried out
   through the building of numerous communities. Simutaneously with the
   fading of the public service units and the living center transfering
   into the residing communties, the communities plays an increasing
   important role. The diversification of the community responsibility
   orgnizations is very important in community-building. This paper first
   discusses the significance of the Non-government community organization
   to the two-typed society, and then analyzes the status quo and problems
   of the Community Non-government organization in China, and finely brings
   forth some suggestions on how to build the Non-government community
